// CoreLocal build profile: the Mac and iPhone hosts, their tests, original fixtures, local
// persistence, and local-only experiments (docs/BUILD_AND_DISTRIBUTION.md).
//
// A target joins this profile by attaching this file in project.yml (`configFiles`).
// Attached today: LabMac, LabMacTests, LabPhone, LabPhoneTests (schemes LabMac-Core and
// LabPhone-Core).
//
// Rules: CoreLocal builds with no team for the Mac and the simulators, and with any team,
// including a free Personal Team, for a device. No CoreLocal target may embed or depend on a
// target from another profile, reference the App Group, Keychain group, or CloudKit identifiers,
// or carry an entitlement other than the Mac App Sandbox. script/build_manifest.py checks the
// built products.

LAB_BUILD_PROFILE = CoreLocal
LAB_PROFILE_EXTERNAL_SETUP = None for the Mac and simulators; any team, including a free Personal Team, for a device
SWIFT_ACTIVE_COMPILATION_CONDITIONS = $(inherited) LAB_PROFILE_CORE_LOCAL
